Options -Indexes

Strip Apache version/PHP info from generated error-page footers
ServerSignature Off

RewriteEngine On
RewriteBase /event-management-system/

Redirect direct PHP page requests to the front controller
RewriteRule ^events.php$         index.php?page=events         [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^event.php$          index.php?page=event          [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^login.php$          index.php?page=login          [R=301,L]
RewriteRule ^register.php$       index.php?page=register       [R=301,L]
RewriteRule ^checkout.php$       index.php?page=checkout       [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^confirmation.php$   index.php?page=confirmation   [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^attendee/(.+).php$  index.php?page=attendee/$1    [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^organizer/(.+).php$ index.php?page=organizer/$1   [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^admin/(.+).php$     index.php?page=admin/$1       [R=301,L,QSA]